                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Technically it is not bad.\n\nThe plot and the characters are shallow and without any meaning.\n\nThe fights drag on for a long time even if you know what you are doing.\n\nYou do not have to grind, though getting decent items becomes slower if you don't.\n\nThe three endings are quite similar and nothing to write home about:\n\n1. You leave alone as the woman.\n2. You leave as the guy and do not Song of Loyalty when outside.\n3. You use Song of Loyalty outside as the dude.",
